      "text": "The Philippine Postal Corporation (PHLPost) has announced that there are some offices that would be open to receive mail or parcels on All Souls' Day on Monday, November 2, 2026."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The following offices are open on Monday, November 2:"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Northeast Luzon Area"
    },
